{"title":"survival or renewal: an illustrated zine for the united nations","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/un-renewal-zine","date":1758705206000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"842\" height=\"595\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/4992b8f7-5088-4210-8545-6d36624df5be/zine+gif+1.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n \n  <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oZPUuwBT5Vb23D1B4IJ-K6g0oYTVzbl4/view\" target=\"_blank\">\n    download the zine\n  </a>\n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>visit </em><a href=\"https://www.departmentofthepossible.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>the department of the possible</em></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p>I spent the last two weeks completely immersed in a 43 page illustrated zine project I created in collaboration with a self-organized group of colleagues within the United Nations — who published the paper under the name, <a href=\"https://www.departmentofthepossible.org/\" target=\"_blank\">the department of the possible.</a> </p><p>the project started from a thought piece they wrote reimagining how to evolve the UN beyond its current crisis, stagnancy and challenges. they wanted to create something radically different from typical UN reports (which look something like <a href=\"https://digitallibrary.un.org/record/4088729?v=pdf\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>). we finished the zine in time for the 80th UN General Assembly this week.<br /></p><h1>systems transformation, inspired by nature </h1><p>the paper is about systems evolution, reimagination, and planting new possibilities, one seed at a time. the paper is organized under 4 ideas for shifts — <strong>purpose, participation, collaboration, and renewal</strong>. </p><p>to me, these ideas seem deeply relevant for ANY system of any size — whether it’s one person working alone, or a leviathan of the nature that is the United Nations. the project came first through collaborating with Ruth, a member of my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/creative-systems\">creative systems</a> course.  I’m noticing so many parallels of transforming and inhabiting systems at both micro and macro scale. <br /><br />*</p><p>I made illustrations for each of these shifts, inspired by metaphors in nature. we designed the entire zine to show its narrative arc of: problems / solutions / possibility. </p><p>I’ll write a separate post about the creative process behind this paper. </p><p>in the meantime, you can <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oZPUuwBT5Vb23D1B4IJ-K6g0oYTVzbl4/view\" target=\"_blank\">download the zine here</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.departmentofthepossible.org/\" target=\"_blank\">visit their website here</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n  <h1>the cover</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=1000w\" width=\"1684\" height=\"1190\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/79003dd8-9e1c-4dd0-9d45-8f370bb74cab/COVER.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n  